# Drafted by Fast Deploy: an allow-list. Nothing enters the image unless a "!" line below lets it in, so a new file (a .env,
# a key, a dataset, a node_modules folder built on a laptop) is never copied into the image by accident. When the service
# needs another file or directory at runtime, add a "!name" line for it.
*
__ALLOW__
# Never in the image, even inside the directories above: the image installs its own node_modules with npm ci.
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.npmrc
**/*.pem
**/test
**/tests
**/*.test.*
**/.DS_Store
